00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Wannan bidiyon yana ba da taƙaitaccen gabatarwa ga na'urar Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Kunna shi ta amfani da wannan maɓallin launin toka.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Da farko, duka ƙarshen Arclight na iya zuwa a lokaci guda.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Idan bai kunna kwata-kwata ko fitulun ba su da ƙarfi, baturin na iya zama a kwance.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Toshe shi ta amfani da cajar USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Lokacin caji, fitilolin kore zasu kunna.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Bayan minti 15, ya kamata a caje shi sosai kuma yayi aiki na sa'o'i da yawa.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Barin shi a cikin hasken rana zai ci gaba da cajin baturi.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ba za ku buƙaci maye gurbin kowane baturi ko kwararan fitila ba.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Yanayin lokacin da ƙarshen duka suka zo don amfanin gaba ɗaya ne.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Canja zuwa yanayin ido ta hanyar riƙe maɓallin ƙasa na daƙiƙa 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Sa'an nan kuma ɗaga yatsanka kuma da sauri sake danna yayin da hasken ya haskaka.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Yanzu kuna cikin yanayin ido, inda ophthalmoscope zai kunna

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
na farko, sa'an nan kuma na gaba part loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Maimaita waɗannan matakan zai sake zagayowar ta hanyoyi daban-daban na amfani guda uku.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Amfani na gaba ɗaya, idanu, sannan kunnuwa.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Da zarar ka zaɓi yanayin da aka fi so, danna maɓallin launin toka

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
yana canza yadda fitulun ke haskakawa da kuma wane ƙarshen ke haskakawa.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Tabbatar cewa kayi amfani da madaidaicin ƙarshen don gwajin daidai.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Ana bincika ido na waje ta amfani da loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Ra'ayin zai bayyana lokacin da kake kusa da ido a kusa da 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
